{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/1.gif?t=1752469527\" /></div><strong>Combat Using a Variety of Weapons</strong>: In <i>One and Done</i>, you'll explore dungeons and battle monsters using four unique weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/2.gif?t=1752469527\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Switching Weapons to Fit the Situation</strong>: Weapons frequently change within the dungeon, so you'll need to strategically utilize each weapon's distinct characteristics and abilities for combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/3.gif?t=1752469527\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Monsters and Battles</strong>: Encounter a wide range of monsters and increasingly powerful foes. Choosing the right weapon to match the enemy's traits can determine the outcome of the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/4.gif?t=1752469527\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploring Maze-like Dungeons</strong>: Navigate through dungeon mazes, uncover hidden paths, defeat enemies, and push forward in your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/5.gif?t=1752469527\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Strategic Options</strong>: Adapt to 